			(property "Description" "Pro Micro-format nRF52840 board (SuperMini nRF52840 / nice!nano clone). P0.02, P0.29, P0.31 are the analog-capable pins. VCC is a 3.3 V output switched by P0.13. RAW (24) and B+ (25) are the battery input (Rook ties them together to its battery); B- (26) is GND. Check RAW on your board before feeding it."
