	(text "R5-R8 + C7-C10: input protection and low-pass (4.7k/100n, about 340 Hz).  R9/R10: I2C pull-ups.  R11: ALERT/RDY is open-drain.  C11 at U3 VDD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.526 122.936 0)
